+`predicts only 1 of 3 scored fields · Not parsed: questions, review outcome`.
+
+**`shellcheck -x` clean** on all six touched files: `hive-common.sh`, `hive-launch`,
+`hive-score`, `hive-close`, `hive-metrics-drill.sh`, `hive-tooling-drill.sh`.
+
+**`scripts/hive-tooling-drill.sh` — cases written, NOT run here, and that is a real gap in this
+report.** The drill drives tmux and emits scratch spine events; this session had neither a live
